      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The skill completed the requested newspaper-search workflow and generated both archive URLs, but the Chronicling America URL has a critical location-filter issue. The required Pennsylvania facet is fa=location_state:pennsylvania; using the bare location_state= parameter does not actually filter the search to Pennsylvania. The Newspapers.com URL was correctly formed. Because one of the two primary searches is improperly scoped."
    },
    {
      "test_id": "ut_search_external_sites_014",
      "dimension_source": "rubric",
      "dimension_name": "URL generation",
      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The Newspapers.com URL was correctly generated with the appropriate keyword, date, region, and county parameters. However, the Chronicling America URL has a critical defect in the Pennsylvania filter: the required fa=location_state:pennsylvania facet must be used because the bare location_state= parameter does not filter the results. The name, date range, and dl=page parameters were otherwise appropriate."
    },
